{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "396db24fa4dede6a217784a4d37eb1179319f20aa4e1c5b8c9ae50e606b6c158", "ja": "公演直前スペシャル#涙腺崩壊#最終回", "zh": "公演前特别节目#眼泪溃堤#最终回", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1bd4c8676db87a3f4986da951ac39246d4c061e5b95d9d97a0b9dc05303d0214", "ja": "ステージ直前、控え室からお届けする生放送\n最終回。#野々原茜#ロコ#ズッ友\n#茜ちゃんだよー#ロコアート\n#茜ちゃん人形#好評発売中！\n#いろいろあったけど2人は仲良し！", "zh": "开演登台前，在准备室播送的直播最终回。\n#野野原茜#ROCO#永远是朋友\n#是小茜唷～#Rocoart\n#小茜娃娃#好评发售中！\n#虽然发生许多事但两人依然感情很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c5fccd9e628cb83baf30d3ea0ce01361bfebc2d6268d9c59e9c2b5d3710bd3e9", "ja": "（遅れていた地方公演のレッスンは、\nみんなの頑張りによって、どうにか巻き返した）", "zh": "（地方公演的练习进度虽然落后，\n但在大家的努力之下，总算是追回来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9e613a7c7b659f88ce6bb36a846138fed7c461aa0efcbdc75bbbd6e8e456a8f8", "ja": "（茜とロコは、特に大変そうだったけど。\nとにかく万全の状態で、地方公演の日を迎えた！）", "zh": "（虽然茜跟ROCO看着好像特别吃力，\n姑且算是以万全的状态迎来地方公演这一天了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1002_null", "source_sha256": "aca4cafd26d7d1453b1968452376994be7430a9a33bf6b039f33d2e34582a245", "ja": "『AKANE★CHANNEL』、オンエア中……", "zh": "《AKANE★CHANNEL》直播中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "61252f877f4ebd655cdc773e965477f712ef70d361d41d3f244e54f1b7ffa436", "ja": "ファンのみんな、集まれ～！\n『AKANE★CHANNEL』の時間だよ☆", "zh": "各位粉丝集合～！\n《AKANE★CHANNEL》的时间到啰☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e1172d2c0fa8865d345f16e9c543e2fbebb101af19b2565ada893ddad7d86fd", "ja": "いよいよ公演、はっじまっるよ～！\nステージ衣装の茜ちゃんも、カワイイでしょ？", "zh": "公演终于要开始了呢～！\n穿上舞台服装的小茜是不是也很可爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "a922c306c4ea2200e53ad28fe318082aea7d5fd135b856f207382992027dd650", "ja": "というワケで、今日は特別編！　ステージ直前の\nアイドルたちの素顔に迫っちゃおう！　チェケラ☆", "zh": "所以呢，今天是特别篇！带大家去看看\n偶像们即将登台前的幕后面貌！Check it out☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "8e779086641bbea6d4c457deb0128c4da55255c7705e88c2c33db61a15dc2d0b", "ja": "あ、えっと……お疲れさんです！\n今日も見てくれて、ありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "啊，那个……辛苦了！\n谢谢大家今天也来收看直播哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "63063bbe86c77c6d2c1a1ae589f486e152d6e3217069f885a80b5e61ad6cbe8c", "ja": "あたしらみんなで、たくさん練習してきたんだわ。\nファンのみんなにも、よろこんでもらえるかなぁ？", "zh": "我们所有人练习了很久。\n不知道能不能让粉丝们也满意哪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "ae76a26fe37e45b80338e8a7477eae88a1478014b77c05c3ec90231a3491731c", "ja": "レッスン、ホンマにメッチャ大変やったわ～。\nもう思い出すだけで震えてくるし……ぶるぶるぶる。", "zh": "练习真的超辛苦的啦～\n光回想起来我就开始发抖了……（浑身发抖）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "9660617a7cf2998107111bbbadc6cec509436bca0b51df49a1f2c10e52763186", "ja": "せやけど、がんばった分、自信もありますんで！\n期待しとってな♪　ほら、亜利沙もなんか言わんと！", "zh": "但也因为付出了这么多努力，我们很有信心！\n请大家拭目以待嘿♪来，亚利沙也要说点什么才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "7b6e5fdc334be7c875f361e868c7ed22ee948cfdafdde6241a917dac18c1929b", "ja": "亜利沙さんもこっちに来て、一緒に挨拶するべさ。", "zh": "亚利沙也过来这边一起跟大家打招呼哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "fc2279c9a978f4e0ae2040a4dc743dbd1c728e60365271687c76ad07363917a4", "ja": "えっ！？　でもでも、ありさはカメラマンですから、\nカメラを見ておかないと……。", "zh": "咦！？可是可是，亚利沙是摄影师，\n要看着摄影机才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "28c6aa5cc566892d1da8a21de403ce4087dc7309945090e54ca8ee6fa71e69d8", "ja": "それなら俺が代わりに見ておくよ。\nいってこい、亜利沙！", "zh": "那我帮你看。\n去吧，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "1e3efdf76160a228f46fd8255a33d7428d182afd326c76894a849e3c50f5e853", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nわかりました、あとはお願いしますっ！　……とうっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n好的，之后就拜托你了……喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "1c60e154048879f7e990cb88a24ef9ca707c8231b9601efccb42939a8aa66b7b", "ja": "ファ、ファンのみなさん、おはようございますっ！\nままま、松田亜利沙、16歳です～っ！", "zh": "各、各位粉丝，大家早！\n我我我、我是松田亚利沙，16岁～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b6b14abf2e45619514bd011e3ef7e8bc36d49e9f426f4ea79ddd32b659c9e75", "ja": "んふふ、亜利沙、メッチャ噛んでるし！", "zh": "呵呵，亚利沙一直吃螺丝耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "12d6db948b279dfb3a35b0ebe26ceccdb5bcccff1a1ed96cfdf0a95d278b724a", "ja": "亜利沙さん、緊張してるねぇ。\n深呼吸したら、落ち着くんでないかい？", "zh": "亚利沙很紧张哪。\n深呼吸一下，应该就会放松了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "e823fd50fd1fbaec101fe2cc90bf410791c75041df632c1d10e815a9c8c2c072", "ja": "ひ、ひなたちゃん、ありがとうございます！\nスー、ハー…………はっ！？　こ、これは！？", "zh": "日、日向，谢谢你！（吸气～吐气～）\n……啊！？这、这是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "3e9eb09d43af5e10c4d48aa7ce16ba962234706775ff18d680f8cef025d1d442", "ja": "ステージ直前の、アイドルちゃんの匂い……。\nふぉぉぉっ！　ありさ、チョー復活ですよ～っ！", "zh": "偶像宝贝登台前的气味……\n唔喔喔喔！亚利沙完全复活啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "f913a72f024296e5d09001e30601fc37ede58c340bc83bd07e6880b7f7bb7270", "ja": "復活したんはええけど……。\n{$P$}さん、コレ放送してええの？", "zh": "复活了是很好啦，不过……\n{$P$}先生，这个可以播出去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d802fd4bdbe5b7ab8933e3e8b22244150a7cc0761c4ea343c5292d080f9dedfa", "ja": "そ、そうだな。\n茜とロコにカメラを切り替えて……っと。", "zh": "也、也对，\n我把画面切回到茜跟ROCO身上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "07b81d83f3f9944847008b0458bd0bf4be61e0843b8cb8f88ca2df09d0cc6a75", "ja": "さあさあっ、ここで耳寄りな新情報！\n茜ちゃんとロコちゃんが歌う、新曲の紹介だ～！", "zh": "来来来！这里要告诉大家一个好消息！\n那就是小茜跟小ROCO合唱的新歌介绍～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "7f61080943fb98e0625f5d9c0a5b1d00797304700c60676615c067e02638db4c", "ja": "はい！　ロコがアカネとデュエットするのは、\nキュートでポップな、恋の歌なんです！", "zh": "是的！ROCO和茜要Duet一首\nCute又Pop的情歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "81dc9dcffa145a4e7927620af08f8b9d7f3a3e36b31ce3279aaf1f318a943305", "ja": "でも、ロコはアートが恋人ですから！　最初なかなか\nイメージできなくて、ディフィカルトでした……。", "zh": "但因为ROCO的情人是Art！\n所以一开始难以Image歌词的意境，觉得好Difficult……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "130489cd73b063d45553173fc58d8abdfa8bd08cb5b9176b5519e924a2f1a7f0", "ja": "そこで、野々原茜ちゃんの登場だ～！　茜ちゃん、\nりるきゃんで鍛えちゃったからね！　恋愛番長だし！", "zh": "这时野野原茜就登场了～！小茜可是在《莉露甜心》\n经过锻炼的呢！而且还是恋爱高手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "948a1c06735797a633af7f1d82c8614be0834e5f88db8888cb09f43e17525b39", "ja": "アカネとふたりでマンガを読んで、トークしました！\nロコもちょっと、コミックに詳しくなりましたよ♪", "zh": "ROCO和茜一起看漫画聊了天！\nROCO对Comic也稍微有点了解了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "17ccaade0ba67c6cd372772ff8c98ce6823685bb8b0201821edd5fa48da782ac", "ja": "その言い方だと、ふたりともマンガに\n詳しくなっただけに聞こえるけど……まぁいいや！", "zh": "小ROCO这个说法，听起来只是小茜我们\n对漫画变得比较了解了……算啦没差！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "639a9ec955b61f0e8ebe7eeeae78d611160b48f975b2c9a44140483e220c9d1c", "ja": "それと、前の放送でちょっとだけ話してた\nマスコットも、完成したよ♪", "zh": "还有就是，在之前直播时有稍微提到一下的\n吉祥物也完成啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "ebefcd8d4ee90fc79b8c80cf10cb442106fa45af5507e845fdfbfbd6b2eeb72c", "ja": "アカネとロコの、自信作ですよ♪\nオーディエンスのみんなも、楽しみにしてくださいね！", "zh": "这可是茜和ROCO的得意之作♪\n各位Audience也敬请期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0089_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_06_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "68ab9cf2430836e6d1f3df59f9df15b1518dc2c91e01c07ab1f5c58c5a99f181", "ja": "それじゃ、配信はここまで！\n続きが知りたい人は、今日の公演を観に来てね！", "zh": "那么直播就到这里！\n想知道后续的人记得要来看今天的公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
